      "text": "Let R be the region that lies inside the polar curve \\( r = 6 - 6 \\sin{\\left(\\theta \\right)} \\) and outside the circle \\( r = 8 \\). Using a calculator, find the area of R. Show the setup for the calculation, and give the value correct to three decimal places.",
