   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "Setting \\( 6 - 6 \\sin{\\left(\\theta \\right)} = 8 \\) gives the intersection angles \\( \\theta \\approx 3.481 \\) and \\( \\theta \\approx 5.943 \\), and between them the limacon is outside the circle, so it is the outer curve.",
