         "text": "The area is one half the integral of the difference of the squares of the radii: \\( A = \\frac{1}{2}\\int_{3.481}^{5.943} \\left(\\left(6 - 6 \\sin{\\left(\\theta \\right)}\\right)^2 - 64\\right)\\,d\\theta \\).",
